abstract: >-
  Software developed for exploring the geographic and
  disciplinary structure of the citation network around six
  Italian universities (UNIBO, UNIMI, UNITO, UNIPD, UPO and
  SNS), as represented in their IRIS repositories.
  In particular, the project addresses two research
  questions: (1) what are the institutions and countries
  (1a), as well as the scholarly disciplines (1b), that
  either cite or are cited by the IRIS publications included
  in OpenCitations of a given institution? And (2) Are
  different institutions showing different citation
  patterns, depending on the specific case (1a or 1b)?
